---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`页面走丢了 · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="这个页面不存在，可能已经被移动或删除。" noindex />
		<style>
			main {
				max-width: 760px;
				padding-top: 4rem;
				text-align: center;
			}
			.code {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: var(--font-display);
				font-size: clamp(5rem, 16vw, 9rem);
				font-weight: 600;
				line-height: 0.95;
				letter-spacing: 0.08em;
				background: var(--grad-ink);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				background-clip: text;
				color: transparent;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			}
			h1 {
				margin: 1.2rem 0 0.6rem;
				font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.4vw, 2rem);
			}
			.lead {
				max-width: 26em;
				margin: 0 auto;
				color: var(--text-muted);
			}
			.actions {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 0.9rem;
				margin-top: 2.2rem;
			}
			.hint {
				margin-top: 2.8rem;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				color: var(--text-muted);
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main id="main-content">
			<p class="code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
			<h1>这一页走丢了</h1>
			<p class="lead">链接可能已经过期，或者地址敲错了一个字。不如回到首页，或者去文章列表里翻翻。</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="btn" href="/">回到首页</a>
				<a class="btn ghost" href="/blog/">浏览文章</a>
			</div>
			<Ornament />
			<p class="hint">如果你确定这个地址应该存在，欢迎通过 GitHub 告诉我。</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
